G_FREQ is a field in the 'generation flags' mask of the monster data (three
low bits to be precise). Wraiths have G_FREQ set to 2 - which should give
50% probability (as they are not very small). However the real difference
lise in the lines above that point:

        if((dest & 2)
#ifdef REINCARNATION
                 || Is_rogue_level(&u.uz)
#endif
           || (level.flags.graveyard && is_undead(mdat) && rn2(3)))
                goto cleanup;

Which shows, that undead on graveyard levels have lower probability of
leaving corpses. That explain why you get your 50% while testing in wizard
mode (you tested on level 1, yes?), while people see lower probability in 
the Valley...

